    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Nobody prepares you for the moment you realize\u2026\nyour mom is getting older!\n\nNot suddenly.\nBut quietly.\n\nShe starts sitting down more often while doing chores.\nTakes longer to get up.\nAvoids stairs.\nSleeps less.\nComplains of body pain\u2026 then continues working anyway \u{1F97A}\n\nAnd the scariest part?\nMost women dismiss these changes as \u201Cnormal aging\u201D for YEARS.\n\nPhysiologically, aging + hormonal changes can gradually affect:\n\u25AB\uFE0F muscle strength\n\u25AB\uFE0F bone density\n\u25AB\uFE0F pelvic floor health\n\u25AB\uFE0F sleep & energy levels\n\nWhich is why symptoms like fatigue, urine leakage, joint pain, weakness or poor balance should not simply be ignored. \n\nBut if you really think about it\u2026\nwhen was the last time your mom genuinely prioritized herself? \u{1F440}\n\nMost moms will book everyone else\u2019s appointments before their own.\nThey\u2019ll remind everyone to eat healthy while surviving on leftovers and chai, right?\nThey\u2019ll continue showing up for everyone, even when their own body is exhausted.\n\n\u2665\uFE0F This Mother\u2019s Day, don\u2019t just celebrate your mom.\nCheck on her. Talk to her. Encourage her to take her health seriously too.\n\nBecause the strongest women often ignore their pain the longest \u{1F90D}\n\n\u27A1\uFE0F Send this to your mom today!\u{1F917}\n.\n.\n.\n.\n[ mother\u2019s day 2026, mother\u2019s health, health and wellness, menopause, premenopausal symptoms, diet and nutrition during menopause, urinary incontinence, mother\u2019s day post, women\u2019s health, obstetrician & Gynecologist, bone health & muscle loss around menopause, aging, health priority, mom, exercise, checkup, fyp, explore page, vitamin deficiency, supplements during menopause, hormonal changes during menopause ]\n#mothersday #health #menopause #dietandexercise #motherhood",
