    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Happy International Women\u2019s Day! \u{1F338}\n\nToday feels extra special as we celebrate not just women, but also 3 wonderful years of Women\u2019s Health Duo. What started as a small step to spread awareness has grown into a beautiful community of women who want to learn, ask, and take charge of their health.\u{1F607}\n\nGrateful for the opportunity to conduct today\u2019s awareness session and have meaningful conversations about women\u2019s wellbeing. Every question asked, every myth broken, and every woman empowered reminds us why we started.\u2728\n\nHere\u2019s to stronger, healthier, and more informed women. \u{1F4AA}\u{1F3FD}\nThank you for being part of this journey \u{1FA77}\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n[ International women\u2019s day, women, awareness session, women\u2019s health talk, myth vs facts, women\u2019s health, gynaecologist, women\u2019s health physiotherapist, 3 years complete, women\u2019s health tips, women community, hormonal imbalance, pregnancy, pelvic health, post partum, menopause, pcos, pcod, endometriosis, international women\u2019s day 2026 ]\n#internationalwomensday #awareness #event #womenshealth #womenempowerment",
