    doctor: "both",
    topics: ["Pilates", "Labor & delivery", "Pelvic floor", "Pregnancy", "Exercise"],
    title: "\u201CCan I exercise during pregnancy?\u201D",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u201CCan I exercise during pregnancy?\u201D\n\u201CIs it safe for my baby?\u201D\n\u201CShould I just rest instead?\u201D\n\nThese are some of the most common questions I hear from almost every pregnant woman I work with.\nAnd honestly? I get it.\n\nI\u2019ve worked with many pregnant patients, and what I see again and again is this:\n\u{1F538}So many doubts.\n\u{1F538} So many myths.\n\u{1F538}So little clear, reliable information.\n\nThat\u2019s exactly why I\u2019m doing this workshop, not to push fitness, but to create awareness.\nBecause the right kind of movement during pregnancy isn\u2019t dangerous\u2026 it\u2019s actually powerful!\n\nWhy this matters:\n\u2714 Helps reduce back pain & body aches\n\u2714 Improves strength, stamina & confidence\n\u2714 Supports better posture & breathing\n\u2714 Prepares your body for labour & recovery\n\u2714 Helps you feel more in control of your pregnancy journey\n\nThis session is for Ahmedabad moms who want clarity, not confusion.\nGentle. Practical. Evidence-based.\nExercises you can actually do at home safely.\n\nIf you\u2019re pregnant and unsure about exercise, this workshop is for you.\n\n\u{1F4AC} Comment \u201CWORKSHOP\u201D to get the details & registration info.\nLimited seats \u2022 Small group \u2022 1st March, Ahmedabad \u{1F49C}\n.\n.\n.\n.\n\n[ pregnancy exercise workshop, first time moms in ahmedabad, myths of exercise during pregnancy, prenatal exercises, dos and donts, myths vs facts, safe home exercises to do at home during pregnancy, pregnancy workshop, womens health physiotherapist, labor and delivery, exercise for labor, pelvic floor exercises, pelvic health, first trimester, second trimester, third trimester, first time moms, pregnant moms, Ahmedabad pregnancy community, thaltej ahmedabad, events in Ahmedabad, 1st march, 2026 events, pregnancy community, prenatal exercise, prenatal pilates, prenatal strength training, QnA regarding pregnancy exercise, exercises for normal delivery, vaginal delivery, c section, child birth education, what to expect in labor, trimester specific exercises, breathing during labor, meditation, lamaze breathing, labor positions, tear during delivery, partner support in labor, Ahmedabad pregnant moms ]\n#pregnancy #event #prenatalexercise #mythvsfact ahmedabad",
