    title: "\u{1F4AB} Ready for an Empowered Birth? \u{1F4AB}",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F4AB} Ready for an Empowered Birth? \u{1F4AB}\n\nChildbirth education isn\u2019t just about breathing, it\u2019s about understanding your body, reducing fear, and building confidence for the big day.\n\n\u{1F5D2}\uFE0F What You\u2019ll Learn:\n\n\u2705 Labor and its stages \u2013 what to expect and when\n\u2705 Pain management techniques that really work\n\u2705 Exercises for each stage to reduce discomfort\n\u2705 Massage techniques for natural pain relief\n\u2705 Partner support for physical and emotional guidance\n\u2705 Perineal massage and episiotomy info to protect your pelvic floor\n\n\u{1F4A5} Why It Matters:\nPrepared parents often have shorter labors, less stress, and faster recoveries!\n\n\u23F0 Limited spots \u2013 don\u2019t miss out!\n\n\u{1F5E8}\uFE0F Comment \u201CLABOR\u201D to join our next batch or DM for details.\n\n#ChildbirthEducation #LaborPrep #naturalbirthprep #ahmedabad #PregnancyJourney #PhysiotherapyForBirth #womenshealthduo #pregnancy #childbirth #laboranddelivery #perinealcare #pelvicfloor #womenshealthphysio #womenshealth #obgyn #partnersupport #gynecphysiotherapy #fyp #labor #laborpains #normaldelivery #csection #thirdtrimester #breastfeeding #momstobe #parenthood #laborpositions #online #lamazebreathing #prenatalclass",
