    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "IVF in a nutshell!\u{1F4AB}\nWhen natural conception needs a nudge, IVF steps in!\n\nIt involves egg stimulation, collection, fertilization in a lab, and placing the embryo back into the uterus.. amazing, right?\n\n\u{1F913}Did you know? IVF success rates can be as high as 40% depending on age and health!\n\nWe believe informed choices make empowered women.\u{1F4AA}\u{1F3FD}\nStay tuned with @womenshealthduo for more fertility-friendly facts!\u{1F917}\n\n#ivf #ivffacts #invitrofertilization #ivfsteps #stepbystep #infertility #fertility #womenshealth #healthandwellness #healthandfitness #pregnant #conception #embryo #embryotransfer #ovumpickup #ovum #ovary #sperm #fertilization #fertilisation #fertileeggs #egg #eggformation #fypage #fyp #obstetricianandgynecologist #obgyn #womenshealthphysio #womenshealthmatters #womenshealthfacts",
