    title: "\u{1F9D0}\u201CHow many scans do I really need during pregnancy?\u201D",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F9D0}\u201CHow many scans do I really need during pregnancy?\u201D\nWe get this one all the time and we\u2019re breaking it down for you!\u{1F917}\n\nEach ultrasound has a purpose & not just cute baby pics (though we love those too!)\u{1F609}\n\nFrom confirming the heartbeat to checking baby\u2019s position before delivery, every scan helps track your baby\u2019s health & development!\u2764\uFE0F\n\nSwipe through to know:\n\u2714\uFE0F Which scan happens when\n\u2714\uFE0F What each scan checks for\n\u2714\uFE0F Why it matters for you & your baby\n\nSwipe, save & share with your fellow moms-to-be or tag someone who\u2019s counting down to their next scan!\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}\n\nGot questions about any scan? Drop them below, we\u2019re always here to help!\u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0F\u{1F447}\u{1F3FD} \n\n[ pregnancy ultrasounds, ultrasound by trimester, prenatal scan guide, NT NB scan, anomaly scan, growth scan pregnancy, color doppler in pregnancy, fetal monitoring, baby position scan, pregnancy scan checklist, third trimester scan, what to expect in pregnancy scans, prenatal care for moms, pregnancy scan explained ]\n\n#pregnancy #fyp #instagood #trendingreels #pregnancyscan #firsttrimester #ultrasound #anomalyscan #secondtrimester #thirdtrimester #pregnant #pregnancy101 \n#ultrasoundscan #fetus #baby #growthscan #prenatalscreening #prenatalscan #test",
