    doctor: "both",
    topics: ["Pregnancy", "Menstrual health", "Patient education", "Carousel"],
    title:
      "Periods. Pregnancy. Menopause. Silent struggles no one talks about. Women go through it all, yet they show up, push t\u2026",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Periods. Pregnancy. Menopause. Silent struggles no one talks about. Women go through it all, yet they show up, push through, and keep going, stronger every time!\u{1F4AA}\u{1F3FD}\n\nBut strength shouldn\u2019t mean suffering in silence. Women deserve better care, more conversations, and real support at every stage of life.\n\nThis \u2728International Women\u2019s Day\u2728 let\u2019s break the stigma, raise awareness, and stand for a healthier future for all women. \nBecause when women thrive, the world thrives!\u{1F30D}\u{1F49C}\n\n\u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0FAs healthcare professionals and women\u2019s health advocates, we\u2019re here to help!\u2764\uFE0F\n\n\u{1F4E2} Tag a strong woman & share this to spread awareness!\n\n#internationalwomensday #womenshealth #womenshealthmatters #womensday #internationalwomensday2025 #iwd #iwd2025 #fyp #happyinternationalwomensday #womenshealthcare #womenshealthphysio #obstetrician #gynecologist #obgyn #women #womenempowerment #empowerment #strongwomen #womensfitness #femaleleaders #empowered #hormonalhealth #menstrualhealth #menopause #pregancy #postpartum #postpartumdepression #fitness #healthandfitness #healthylifestyle",
