    doctor: "both",
    topics: ["Labor & delivery", "Pregnancy", "Patient education", "Posts"],
    title:
      "Why Doctors Recommend Left Side Sleeping during Pregnancy and especially in 3rd trimester?",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Why Doctors Recommend Left Side Sleeping during Pregnancy and especially in 3rd trimester?\n\n\u27A1\uFE0FSleeping on your left side boosts blood flow to the placenta, giving your baby all the oxygen and nutrients it needs. It also helps reduce pressure on the inferior vena cava, easing swelling and discomfort. \n\n\u27A1\uFE0FThis position lowers the risk of stillbirth and ensures your baby gets a steady oxygen supply. It also promotes the best fetal positioning for labor. \n\nCan you sleep on either side?\u{1F914}\nWhile both sides are better than your back, left side sleeping is the most beneficial for both you and baby during the 3rd trimester!\u{1FAF6}\u{1F3FD}\n\nHave you been trying this? Share your thoughts or tag a friend who needs this tip! \u{1F4AC}\u{1F447}\u{1F3FD}\n\n[Pregnancy, Sleeping position, Left side lying, Benefits of left side lying, Pregnancy tips, Womens health, Obstetrician & Gynecologist, Womens Health Physiotherapist, Pregnant, Foetus, Health and wellbeing]\n\n#pregnancy #fyp #pregnancytips #tips #leftside #sleeping #positions #swelling #blood #bloodflow #pregnancydiary #womenshealth #fetus #baby #babyhealth #lowbackpain #complications #instababy #pregnancyworkout #pregnancyhealth #obgyn #womenshealthphysio #physiotherapy #physicaltherapy #pelvichealth #pelvicfloor #laboranddelivery #instagood #pregnancylife #medical",
    postedAt: "2024-12-24T16:25:51.000Z",
    approxViews: 15,
    instagramPosterUrl:
      "https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/623461829_17955557889061769_4764468307635555682_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_s1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHXUtWWc6wpNXvOduHLGLT953MvRJ5GGEQo1wSWVgFAkTl-YPzm4XA8q9OkaO17sh8&_nc_ohc=pOK2N72-QBEQ7kNvwF8qlCQ&_nc_gid=DkG6sJGQc_2eF_-f9tdq4A&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQB5HOww9aRCo_TojnAqEt0ojeVy15NcWqrpVLqW23a0qQ&oe=6A58596D&_nc_sid=c6f216",
