    topics: ["Pregnancy", "Carousel"],
    title: "How Big is Your Baby?\u{1F37C}\u2728",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "How Big is Your Baby?\u{1F37C}\u2728\n\nEver wonder if your little one is the size of a lemon, mango, or even a pumpkin?\u{1F914} \nTracking your baby\u2019s growth week-by-week not only makes pregnancy even more exciting but also helps monitor essential development milestones. \nFrom fetal length to estimated weight, each measurement gives insight into your baby\u2019s well-being and overall growth!\u{1F4CF}\u{1F497}\n\n\u203C\uFE0FKeep in mind, these sizes are just averages, your baby\u2019s growth may differ, and that\u2019s perfectly normal! \n\n\u{1F505}Factors like genetics, maternal health, and even amniotic fluid levels can make every pregnancy unique, which is why regular check-ups with your gynecologist are so important. They\u2019ll guide you through each milestone and ensure everything is progressing smoothly.\u{1F4AC}\n\nWhat week are you in, and what size is your baby this week? Share below\u2935\uFE0F\nAnd Tap Save to keep this post handy as your baby\u2019s journey unfolds!\u{1F338}\u{1F476}\u{1F3FB}\n\n#babies #fetus #pregnancy #pregnant #weekbyweek #weekbyweekpregnancy #pregnant_world #fetusdevelopment #babydevelopment #cutebaby #babiesofinstagram #baby #fyp #trend #instagood #instagram #obgyn #obstetrician #development #pregnantbelly #pregnancylife #prenatal #pregnancydiary #ahmedabad #valsad #india",
    postedAt: "2024-11-08T11:39:29.000Z",
    approxViews: 24,
    instagramPosterUrl:
      "https://scontent-bos5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/656240788_18082348256346103_6725555868153714648_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ig_cache_key=MzQ5Njc1NzIzMjg2NTA4MjAyNA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMTA4MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=D-9nQMe29bkQ7kNvwHH3i1p&_nc_oc=AdpbrDLSqSC_KvocT6EGsV-cyPcQ4YYxQyBTNnqVI2Q1dSK7Ej5OBIaVq0OkXHWnECc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bos5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=WFkN5KddO5mBnqAPHnBgJA&_nc_ss=72689&oh=00_AQDB1G7Gr1HMPgKQkEpRq77YufQNMyLjpTqVQ5VLbIWD_g&oe=6A582F0B",
