    title: "Could your workout be affecting your hormones? \u{1F937}\u200D\u2640\uFE0F\u2728",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Could your workout be affecting your hormones? \u{1F937}\u200D\u2640\uFE0F\u2728\nSwipe to discover how undereating and over-exercising can lead to 5 key hormonal imbalances and why balance is crucial for your health. \n\nRemember girls - the key to maintaining your health lies in the balance of effort and rest. \n\nEmpower yourself with the right knowledge and take charge of your wellness. \n\n\u{1F48C}Comment below or DM us - we\u2019re here to support you!\n\nDr. Charmi Shah (M.S. OBGYN)\nDr. Zalak Shah (Women\u2019s Health Physio)\n\u{1F4DE} +91-7990550754\n\u{1F4E7} contact@womenshealthduo.com\n\n#hormonehealth #hormonebalance #hormoneimbalance #fitness #highintensity #training #hiit #workout #women #womenshealth #obgyn #cortisol #womenshealthphysio #insulinresistance #thyroid #menstruation #menstrualhealth #ahmedabad #valsad #gujarat #fyp #instagood #womenshealthmatters",
