    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0FEmpowering women through understanding, knowledge and awareness!\u{1F4AB}\n\n\u{1FA77}This International Women\u2019s Day, we hosted a groundbreaking seminar shedding light on the often overlooked journey of PERIMENOPAUSE. \n\u{1F539}From debunking myths to embracing change, we navigated through this transitional phase with grace and knowledge. \n\u{1F539}Together, we\u2019re rewriting the narrative, breaking taboos, and celebrating the strength and resilience of women everywhere.\u{1F4AA}\u{1F3FD}\n\u2728Here\u2019s to embracing every stage of womanhood and supporting each other through it all.\u2764\uFE0F\n\nAre you going through this transitional phase of Menopause? Do you want to know more about it and how to manage it?",
