    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u27A1\uFE0FIntrauterine Insemination (IUI) is a fertility procedure where specially prepared sperm is strategically placed into a woman\u2019s uterus during ovulation. It\u2019s a targeted intervention designed to enhance the chances of fertilization.\n\n\u2757\uFE0FIf you\u2019ve been trying to conceive without success for a year (or six months if you\u2019re over 35), it might be time to consult a gynecologist. \n\nExpert guidance can make all the difference on your fertility journey.\u{1F31F}",
