    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}Prenatal Pilates isn't just a workout; it's a game-changer for expectant moms.\n\u2B50Here are five key benefits:\n\n\u{1FA84} Strong Core: Prenatal Pilates focuses on strengthening the deep core muscles, like the transverse abdominis and pelvic floor. This added support not only helps you carry your growing belly more comfortably but also assists in stabilizing your lower back and pelvis, reducing the risk of pain and injury.\n\n\u{1FA84} Improved Posture: As your baby bump grows, the demands on your postural muscles increase. Prenatal Pilates emphasizes proper alignment and engages muscles such as the erector spinae to help you maintain an upright posture, reducing the strain on your back and neck.\n\n\u{1FA84} Boosts Circulation: Prenatal Pilates incorporates controlled breathing and movement. This combination promotes better blood circulation, which can help reduce swelling and discomfort in your extremities and enhance the delivery of nutrients to your baby.\n\n\u{1FA84} Reduced Back Pain: Pregnancy-related back pain is common, but Prenatal Pilates can help. By strengthening the muscles that support your spine, you can experience relief from the discomfort often associated with pregnancy.\n\n\u{1FA84} Preparation for Labor: Prenatal Pilates places an emphasis on controlled, rhythmic breathing and pelvic floor exercises. These techniques are invaluable in labor and delivery, helping you maintain endurance and manage pain effectively. \n\n\u{1F48C}Contact us today to book your Prenatal Pilates session and start your journey to a healthier and more comfortable pregnancy\u{1F496}",
    postedAt: "2023-10-19T17:34:44.000Z",
    approxViews: 10,
    instagramPosterUrl:
      "https://scontent-dfw6-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/623465593_18084729047130092_2258903789766003483_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_s1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGrJIjhhHqRO8vATiJB2xOAWfEfrIAVbNUuG5goTGGbShnAjQ_mDBsU_J-QxjqIWAI&_nc_ohc=vnKTrZx1-YsQ7kNvwG0ezdv&_nc_gid=bWYOXKf4nd5YqTC49Ob1LQ&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQAPi7Xio_hVKpVNhim9Oe0A6Q1K_LIyP2YU83rmGxgXuA&oe=6A583CB3&_nc_sid=c6f216",
