    title:
      "\u{1F30D} Today, on World Contraception Day, let's talk about the power of choice, empowerment, and reproductive health! As \u2026",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F30D} Today, on World Contraception Day, let's talk about the power of choice, empowerment, and reproductive health! As a gynecologist, I'm passionate about helping individuals make informed decisions about their bodies. \u{1F4AA}\n\n\u{1F4A1} Contraception is not just about preventing pregnancies; it's about giving people the autonomy to plan their futures, pursue their dreams, and prioritize their well-being. Every individual deserves access to safe and effective contraception options.\n\n\u{1F52C} Knowledge is key! Educate yourself and consult with healthcare professionals to find the contraception method that suits you best. Remember, there's no one-size-fits-all solution.\n\n\u{1F91D} Let's break the stigma surrounding contraception and foster open, judgment-free conversations. Together, we can empower people to take control of their reproductive health. \u{1F495}",
    postedAt: "2023-09-26T18:08:40.000Z",
    approxViews: 14,
