    title:
      "The good old tetanus shot is replaced with a more effective Tdap vaccine which covers additional diseases like Diphte\u2026",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "The good old tetanus shot is replaced with a more effective Tdap vaccine which covers additional diseases like Diphteria and Pertussis along with Tetanus. \n\n\u27A1\uFE0FBy getting this vaccine during pregnancy, mothers can pass on antibodies to their babies offering them protection during their vulnerable 1st months of life! \n\n\u{1F4CC}ACOG recommends receiving Tdap vaccine between 27-36 weeks of each pregnancy!\n\n\u{1F48C}DM us for consultation and to know more!\u{1F60A}",
    postedAt: "2023-06-05T17:42:45.000Z",
