    title:
      "\u27A1\uFE0FBoth mum and baby gain benefits from breastfeeding, and many of these advantages last a lifetime.",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u27A1\uFE0FBoth mum and baby gain benefits from breastfeeding, and many of these advantages last a lifetime.\n\n\u2728The actions you take today will affect both the future of you and your child! How amazing is that?\n\n\u27A1\uFE0FThe majority of these advantages for mum are cumulative, so the longer you breastfeed, the greater the advantages you experience.\n\n\u{1F538}It is important to note that breastfeeding is a personal choice and decision to breastfeed and for how long is upto each individual mother and her child. \nBut if you want to give your baby the best start in life consider breastfeeding.\n\n\u{1F446}\u{1F3FD}Have a look in to some important benefits of Breastfeeding\n\n\u{1F48C}DM us for more such information and consultation!\u{1F60A}",
