    doctor: "both",
    topics: ["Exercise", "Menstrual health", "Posts"],
    title:
      "\u{1F538}Period cramps can be very uncomfortable & painful for those who suffer from them regularly but there are few ways b\u2026",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F538}Period cramps can be very uncomfortable & painful for those who suffer from them regularly but there are few ways by which you can decrease their impact & go on with your life as usual. \nRegular exercise is one of them.\n\n\u27A1\uFE0FRegular exercise can help reduce period cramps in number of ways: \n\n- it increases blood flow to pelvic area \n- releases endorphins (natural painkiller)\n- reduces stress\n- improves over-all health\n- strengthens the muscles of abdomen & back \n\n\u{1F4CC}If you experience severe or persistent menstrual cramps, it's important to talk to your Gynecologist to rule out any underlying medical condition & discuss treatment options.\n\n\u{1F48C}DM us for more!\u{1F60A}",
    postedAt: "2023-04-22T18:08:21.000Z",
    approxViews: 31,
    instagramPosterUrl:
      "https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/622677509_18089628779017137_1619814372594212349_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_s1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHtCZinj3zGRl3xJuPuRGw9vPvjBZiNgVlbCXGirbr0IwTnpw7aL6ihzqdP7I7vV9k&_nc_ohc=5pUKq9xy9y0Q7kNvwGZa8fv&_nc_gid=MC8FEHF6G-8X10rNaP_bYg&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQBFcicVJyka0EuscOgpla_zxowrOZZDRGkOECAe789vBA&oe=6A583CDC&_nc_sid=c6f216",
    instagramPosterPath: "/images/hub-thumbs/igp-crwrid9vcnb.jpg",
