    title:
      "\u2728CESAREAN (C-section) AWARENESS MONTH is a global campaign to educate society about the importance of surgical births\u2026",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u2728CESAREAN (C-section) AWARENESS MONTH is a global campaign to educate society about the importance of surgical births and when they become a problem.\n\nC-section is a life-saving procedure for women in need, but it can also be harmful when performed unnecessarily.\n\nThe campaign aims to reduce avoidable caesareans, support post-cesarean recovery, and advocate for vaginal birth after caesarean.\n\nWhen it comes to childbirth options, the month also aims to raise awareness about the importance of informed consent and shared decision making between healthcare providers and their patients.\n\n\u{1F4CC}Before we proceed, we must ensure that we are all on the same page..\n\u27A1\uFE0FC-sections are NOT EASIER than vaginal births \n\u27A1\uFE0FC-section requires RECOVERY \n\u27A1\uFE0FC-section DOES NOT INVALIDATE your birthing experience\n\u27A1\uFE0FC-sections do not give you a free pass on the effects on your PELVIC FLOOR.\n\nRemember, it is not cesarean prevention month! \n\nLet's promote EQUALITY, EDUCATION & WOMEN'S CHOICE!\u{1F497}",
    postedAt: "2023-04-06T12:54:22.000Z",
    approxViews: 21,
    instagramPosterUrl:
      "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/622468436_18082597721235582_2768780554335137295_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_s1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFBC6lDbVL0ATIltQbaIp53avEK5Xf4xDHBkt9RLXAkUkQtGphNJm5yuCxD00llhwk&_nc_ohc=lr62p-H_-PEQ7kNvwG1SDrc&_nc_gid=QvvREjQFKlatTrnEXtvEFA&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQAzqvTmaqSAyTSKghs4Cstm9w9TZemfCUECO06Ml8F8zA&oe=6A583166&_nc_sid=c6f216",
