    title:
      "Tuberculosis is a widespread disease in developing countries such as India. Let us know something about GENITAL TUBER\u2026",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Tuberculosis is a widespread disease in developing countries such as India. Let us know something about GENITAL TUBERCULOSIS on this WORLD TUBERCULOSIS DAY!\nIt is quite common after TB infection elsewhere in the body and spreads primarily through the bloodstream to the genital organs.\nIt is a silent disease, requiring a high level of suspicion for proper diagnosis and treatment.\n\nSymptoms are weight loss, fever, dull aching pain in lower abdomen, menstrual irregularities, and  can also cause infertility.\nIt is estimated that nearly 20% of infertile Indian women have Genital TB.\n\nGet yourself screened for Genital TB! \n\u{1F48C}DM us for more!",
    postedAt: "2023-03-24T17:09:23.000Z",
    approxViews: 26,
    instagramPosterUrl:
      "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/623086965_18106125859706046_8333712157700256773_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_s1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHnTOwbQgKDWghnVqgG-xs5Jiw8SIajb3kJ5uK3NCh_MPYqyXOP--X7oVFk3ZDFWhY&_nc_ohc=PvsLO34-8lsQ7kNvwGhJkv1&_nc_gid=1rrD3zLKL7d75YRcXUQH4Q&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQAzQ3K-1HvnnD2cq63HuEOKaedMP9md8-gIDVe2M5zRqg&oe=6A5839D1&_nc_sid=c6f216",
