    title:
      "How many of these treatments have you been advised to try? How many have you attempted?",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "How many of these treatments have you been advised to try? How many have you attempted?\n\nMany of these may alleviate your symptoms, but none of them will cure the disease.\nThe GOLD standard treatment is Laproscopy/Excision surgery, but it has its own drawbacks.\n\nThere is no 'one-size-fits-all' approach to treatment.\nWhat works for one person may not be suitable for another.\nPlease do not give up if a treatment does not work for you.\n\nConsult your doctor about any other options that may be available to you.\n\nDISCLAIMER: The information in this post is provided solely for educational purposes and is not intended to be a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.\n\n\u{1F48C} DM us for more information and Consultation!",
