    title:
      "ENDOMETRIOSIS affects each individual differently, depending on where the Endometrial tissue grows.",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "ENDOMETRIOSIS affects each individual differently, depending on where the Endometrial tissue grows.\n\nRecognizing Endometriosis symptoms is the first step towards advocating for yourself.\n\n\u25B6\uFE0F The five D's are as follows:\nDYSMENORRHEA - Painful period\nDYSPAREUNIA - Painful sexual intercourse \nDEEP PELVIC PAIN - Lower abdominal pain and heaviness \nDYSCHEZIA - Painful Bowel movement \nDYSURIA - Painful urination \n\nAll of these symptoms could be caused by something other than Endometriosis. This is why Endometriosis is so difficult to diagnose and requires a highly skilled doctor.\n\nDon't dismiss it!!\n\u{1F48C} DM us to know more!",
