    title: "Hello to everyone,",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Hello to everyone,\nWe (Dr. Charmi Shah - M.S. OBGYN & Dr. Zalak Shah (PT) - MPT Women's Health) have decided to start this page dedicated to women's health on this International Women's Day 2023.\n\nThe health of a woman is her capital, and it should be at the top of your priority list!\u{1F4DD}\n\nWe at @redefiningwomenshealth , will be discussing everything from puberty to menopause!\u{1F497}\n\n\u{1F48C} DM us for consultation!",
