    instagramCaption:
      "Behind every doctor is a mom who sacrificed silently for yearsss \u{1F90D}\u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0F\n\nTo the world I\u2019m a doctor\u2026\nTo my mom I\u2019m still her little girl \u{1F979}\u{1F467}\u{1F3FB}\n\nPeople see the scrubs, the OT hours, the responsibility, the babies I help bring into this world\u2026\nBut behind all of it is a mother who shaped me with love, strength, prayers, patience and endless support.\n\nI wouldn\u2019t be the woman, the doctor, or the caregiver I am today without her \u{1FAF6}\u{1F3FB}\n\nNo matter how many lives we care for, we\u2019ll always go back to being our mom\u2019s little girl at heart \u2665\uFE0F\n\nHappy Mother\u2019s Day to every mother raising strong daughters and kind humans \u{1F917}\n\nTag your mom or send this to her if she\u2019s your biggest strength!\u{1FAF6}\u{1F3FB}\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n[ mothers day 2026, doctor, raised by strong woman, women sacrifices, motherhood, mother\u2019s love, gynecologist, obstetrician, labor and delivery, pregnancy, mother\u2019s day post, how my mom sees me, mom, mummy, mom love, laparoscopy, surgeon, ivf specialist, fertility, women\u2019s health, fyp, explore page, behind every strong woman is her mom,]\n#mothersday #strongmom #doctor #daughter #fyp",
