    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F9D0}Choosing a Pilates certification can feel SO confusing\u2026 and honestly, it is.\n\nHi, I\u2019m Dr. Zalak Shah(PT), a women\u2019s health physiotherapist & STOTT-certified Pilates instructor \u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0F\nAnd I\u2019ve seen how this one decision can literally shape your entire career.\n\nWith so many options out there..\n\u2728 different fees (some costing lakhs)\n\u2728 different prerequisites\n\u2728 different teaching styles & credibility\n\n\u2026it\u2019s easy to feel stuck or choose blindly.\n\nSo I did the deep research for you\nComparing top certifications in India & internationally..\nwhat they offer, who they\u2019re best for, and what actually matters.\n\nIf you\u2019re a physio, fitness trainer, or yoga instructor.. this will help you choose SMART.\n\nFollow @womenshealthduo & Comment down \u201CPILATES\u201D.. I\u2019ll send you the full guide \u{1F4E9}\n\nStay tuned for more on everything women\u2019s health & Pilates \u2728\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n[ best pilates certification courses, pilates certified instructor, pilates as a career, physiotherapist, fitness, healthcare, STOTT pilates, BASI, Balanced body, polestar, host training centres, pilates courses in india, pilates course fees, what is pilates, guide on pilates certification courses, how to apply for pilates certification course, women\u2019s health physiotherapist, obstetrician and gynecologist, women\u2019s health ]\n#pilatescertification #guide #pilatesacademy #pilatesinstructor #fyp",
