    instagramCaption:
      "Be honest \u{1F440}\nHow many of you thought this? \u{1F914}\n\n\u201CI\u2019ve never exercised in my life\u2026\nso pregnancy exercise is NOT for me.\u201D \u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}\u{1F605}\n\nHere\u2019s the truth (from a women\u2019s health physio):\n\n\u27A1\uFE0FYou don\u2019t need a gym past to start exercising in pregnancy.\n\u27A1\uFE0F Pregnancy is NOT the time for sudden HIIT or heavy workouts.\n\u27A1\uFE0F It IS the time for safe, guided, pregnancy-specific movement.\n\nThink of it like, you wouldn\u2019t start sprinting on Day 1, right? \u{1F3C3}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2640\uFE0F \n\nBut you can start with:\n\u2714\uFE0F breathing\n\u2714\uFE0F gentle mobility\n\u2714\uFE0F posture correction\n\u2714\uFE0F basic strength meant for pregnancy\n\nThat\u2019s actually what helps with:\n\u2022 back & pelvic pain\n\u2022 fatigue\n\u2022 better delivery prep\n\u2022 smoother recovery postpartum\n\nAnd because SO many moms are confused about this,\nI\u2019m hosting an in-person Pregnancy Exercise Workshop \u{1FAF6}\u{1F3FD}\n\n\u{1F4CD} Ahmedabad\n\u{1F4C5} 1st March\n\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB} For pregnant moms - even if you\u2019ve never exercised before\n\n\u{1F4AC} Comment \u201CWORKSHOP\u201D and I\u2019ll share all the details with you \u{1F495}\n\n(And yes \u2014 beginners are MORE than welcome \u{1F609})\n.\n.\n.\n.\n[ exercise in pregnancy, prenatal exercises, doubts in exercise during pregnancy, exercise for normal delivery, exercise guidance during pregnancy, dos and donts, myth vs fact, strength training in pregnancy, short series, part 3, prenatal pilates, benefits of exercise during pregnancy, labor and delivery, exercise for labor, natural delivery, vaginal delivery, indian pregnant moms, posture in pregnant, ahmedabad moms, first time moms, exercise confusion, workshop, womens health physiotherapist ]\n#fyp #firsttimemom #ahmedabad #prenatalexercise #workshop",
