    instagramCaption:
      "Quick question for pregnant moms \u2B07\uFE0F\nDo you think this is enough?\n\u27A1\uFE0F \u201CI walk 15\u201320 mins after meals, so I\u2019m exercising.\u201D\n\nIf YES, read this!!\n\n\u{1F6B6}\u200D\u2640\uFE0F Walking is great\nBut \u274C walking alone is not complete pregnancy exercise.\n\nHere\u2019s why \u2B07\uFE0F\n\n\u2714\uFE0F Pregnancy needs strength training (to support your growing belly)\n\u2714\uFE0F Pelvic floor exercises (to prevent leaks & prepare for delivery)\n\u2714\uFE0F Mobility & posture work (back pain, pelvic pain = very common)\n\u2714\uFE0F Breathing & core connection (often missed completely!)\n\n\u{1F4CC} That\u2019s why many moms who only walk still get:\n\u2022 Back & pelvic pain\n\u2022 Urine leaks\n\u2022 Poor stamina during labour\n\n\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}Pregnancy needs more than just walking.\n\nAnd the right exercises depend on:\n\u2022 Your trimester\n\u2022 Your body type\n\u2022 Your pregnancy symptoms\n\n\u{1F49B} This is exactly what I teach in my Pregnancy Exercise Workshop\nSafe. Simple. Science-based.\n\n\u{1F447}\u{1F3FD} Comment \u201CWORKSHOP\u201D for more details! \n\u{1F552} Limited slots available\n\n.\n.\n.\n.\n\n.\n.\n.\n\n.\n[ pregnant moms in ahmedabad, pregnancy questions, most common questions, walking during pregnancy, how much exercise should one do in pregnancy, prenatal safe exercises, first trimester, second trimester, third trimester, labor and delivery, exercise for normal delivery, myth vs facts about exercise in pregnant, workshop, workshop for pregnant moms in Ahmedabad, trimester specific exercises, india ]\n#walkinginpregnancy #mythvsfact #prenatalexercise #workshop #ahmedabad",
