    instagramCaption:
      "Pregnant and confused about exercise even with an uncomplicated pregnancy?\n\nIf you\u2019re constantly wondering \u201CIs this safe?\u201D or \u201CShould I even be doing this?\u201D \nYou\u2019re not alone.\n\nI work with pregnant women every day, and the most common thing I see isn\u2019t lack of effort.. it\u2019s fear because of confusing advice.\n\nPart 1 of this series is about strength training during pregnancy.. what\u2019s safe, what needs guidance, and why random advice can feel overwhelming.\n\nThat\u2019s exactly why I\u2019m hosting a small, offline pregnancy exercise awareness workshop.. to clear doubts, explain what\u2019s safe, and help you move with confidence, not fear.\n\n\u{1F4CD} Ahmedabad | \u{1F5D3} 1st March\n\u{1F469}\u200D\u2695\uFE0F Led by a Women\u2019s Health Physiotherapist\n\u26A0\uFE0F Limited seats | In-person only\n\n\u{1F4AC} Comment \u201CWORKSHOP\u201D and I\u2019ll share the details with you.\n.\n.\n.\n[ Exercise in Pregnancy, Strength training in pregnancy, Workshop for pregnant women in Ahmedabad, first trimester, second trimester, third trimester, back pain in pregnancy, pelvic pain in pregnancy, fatigue in pregnancy, guidance for exercise, women\u2019s health physiotherapist, labor and delivery, exercise for normal delivery, normal delivery vs c section, pregnancy and confused, prenatal exercise, prenatal strength training, prenatal pilates, workshop, q&a, myth vs facts about exercise during pregnancy ]\n#pregnancy #strengthtraining #workshop #ahmedabad #womenshealthphysiotherapist",
