    instagramCaption:
      "We get it, it looks cute!\u{1F481}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2640\uFE0F\nPregnant bellies, baby giggles, stretches on mats\u2026\n\nBut here\u2019s what it really is:\n\u{1F539} Life-saving surgeries\n\u{1F539} Pain that\u2019s brushed off as \u201Cnormal\u201D\n\u{1F539} Pelvic floor issues no one warns you about\n\u{1F539} Education that most women never receive\n\u{1F539} Recovery that doesn\u2019t end at 6 weeks postpartum\n\nWe\u2019re not here to sugarcoat it.\nWe\u2019re here to support, guide, and empower,  with science, not shame.\nBecause women\u2019s health deserves more than \u201Cjust manage it.\u201D\n\n\u{1F46F}\u200D\u2640\uFE0F If you\u2019ve ever said \u201CWhy did no one tell me this?\u201D we\u2019re here for you.\n\n\u{1F447}\u{1F3FD} Tag a friend who needs to hear this.\n\u{1FA77} And tell us in the comments, what do you wish was taught earlier?\n\n#holyfknairball #women #womenshealth #womenshealthmatters #pelvichealth #obgyn #ahmedabad #womenshealthphysio #pregnant #pregnancy #fyp #instagood #soulsurvivor #tips #facts #doctor #education #empowerment #womenempowerment #patient #healthcare #healthy #healthandfitness #lifestyle #womensupportingwomen #puberty #menstrualhealth #period #hormonalhealth #pcos",
