    instagramCaption:
      "Ever noticed bleeding when it\u2019s not your period?\u{1FA78}\u{1F914}\n\nThat\u2019s called intermenstrual bleeding and it could be your body\u2019s way of asking for attention.\n\nFrom \u{1F504} hormonal imbalances (like PCOS or thyroid issues) to \u{1F9A0} infections, \u{1F9EC} fibroids, or even \u{1F930} early pregnancy \u2013 there are several possible causes.\n\n\u{1F4AB}But here\u2019s the important part:\nIf it\u2019s happening often, comes with pain \u{1F616}, or just feels off, don\u2019t ignore it. \nA visit to your \u{1F469}\u200D\u2695\uFE0F gynac can help you get to the root of it.\n\nYour body talks, learn to listen!\u{1F497}\n\u{1F64C}\u{1F3FD}Tag someone who needs to know this!\n\n#womenshealth #obgyn #ahmedabad #fyp #womenshealthphysio #instagood #gynecologist #obstetrician #bleeding #spotting #hormonalimbalance #pcos #pcod #thyroid #birthcontrol #pills #pregnancy #infection #vaginalinfection #pregnant #valsad #fyp\u30B7 #gynecology #period #periodbleed #doctor #medico #pcostreatment #endometriosis #womenshealthmatters",
