    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Told to do squats and butterfly pose to \u2018bring on labor\u2019?\u{1F9D0}\nSounds familiar, right?\n\nThese moves are great for mobility, but if they really started labor\u2026 we\u2019d all be delivering on yoga mats!\u{1F61B}\n\nLabor is a complex, beautiful process involving hormones, baby\u2019s position, and how your body and mind are working together\u{1F4AB}\nJust stretching isn\u2019t enough, preparation is key!\u{1F511} \n\nIn our Childbirth Education Class, we help you understand your body, manage labor pain, and feel confident for birth!\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}\n\nWant the real tools to prep for labor?\n\u2B07\uFE0FComment down \u2018LABOR\u2019 and we\u2019ll send you the details regarding the CHILDBIRTH EDUCATION CLASS!\u{1F4F2}\n\u{1F48C}DM us to know more!\n\n[ Women\u2019s Health, Childbirth Education Class, Labor & Delivery, Labor Class, Pregnancy Labor Class, Labor and Delivery Class, Exercises for Labor and Delivery, Birth prep class, Breathing exercises, Women\u2019s Health Physiotherapist, Ahmedabad, Gujarat, Pregnancy Labor Prep, Exercises for Labor, Partner support, Natural Delivery, Cesarean section, Normal Vaginal Delivery, Obstetrician & Gynecologist, India ]",
