    instagramCaption:
      "Mirena -\nThe Long-Term Birth Control You Should Know About!\n\n\u2714\uFE0F What is Mirena? \nA hormone-releasing intrauterine device (IUD) that provides up to 8 years of contraception.\n\u2714\uFE0F How does it work? \nReleases levonorgestrel, which thickens cervical mucus, thins the uterine lining, and may stop ovulation.\n\u2714\uFE0F Who can use it? \nIdeal for women looking for long-term, reversible birth control or relief from heavy periods.\n\n\u2714\uFE0F Benefits:\n\u2705 99% effective\n\u2705 Reduces heavy bleeding\n\u2705 Can be removed anytime when planning pregnancy\n\n\u2714\uFE0F Side effects? \nInitial irregular spotting but usually improves over time.\n\nTalk to your gynecologist to see if Mirena is right for you!\u{1F44D}\u{1F3FD}\n\n#mirena #intrauterinedevice #iud #iuds #coppert #gynecology #obgyn #womenshealth #fyp #ahmedabad #pregnancy #instagood #pregnant #instagram #pregnancytips #heavyperiods #adenomyosis #menstrualhealth #menstrualcramps #menses #uterus #uterinelining #health #healthylife #reproductivehealth #contraception #contraceptive #hormonetherapy #hormones #hormonalbalance",
