    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1FA78} Menstrual Cycle 101 \u{1FA78}\n\n\u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0FLet\u2019s break down the basics of the menstrual cycle, it\u2019s more than just your period!\u2935\uFE0F\n\n\u{1F504} Phases:\n\n1. Menstrual Phase - Shedding of the uterine lining = your period!\n2. Follicular Phase - FSH stimulates follicle growth, prepping an egg.\n3. Ovulation - Mid-cycle, high LH levels trigger the release of an egg.\n4. Luteal Phase - Progesterone rises, stabilizing the uterine lining for a possible pregnancy.\n\n\u{1F4A1}Why It Matters:\n\u2728Understanding your cycle helps you notice changes in mood, energy, and even metabolism! It\u2019s essential for tracking fertility, managing symptoms like PMS, and identifying potential issues like PCOS, irregular cycles, or hormonal imbalances. \n\u27A1\uFE0FFactors like stress, diet, exercise, and sleep all play a role in regulating a normal cycle, knowing this empowers you to keep your cycle on track and spot early signs of imbalance.\n\n\u{1F9D0}Curious about how each phase affects you? Drop questions below!\u{1F447}\u{1F3FD} \n\nVideo credit - Design cell\n#menstruation #101 #basic #instagood #fyp #menstruationmatters #menstrualcycle #menstrualhealth #hormones #hormonalimbalance #pregnancy #egg #fertility #fertilization #pcos #pcod #endo #endometriosis #menstrualcup #hygiene #ivf #infertility #obgyn #womenshealth #ovulation #healthandwellness #instagram #womenempowerment #physiotherapy #period",
