    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}Baby\u2019s First Moves: What to Expect and When\u{1F970}\n\n\u{1FA84}Feeling baby kicks is a magical part of pregnancy! \n\nHere\u2019s a quick guide to what you might feel as the months go by:\n\n\u{1F338} 16-20 Weeks: Those first fluttery kicks might feel like butterflies - light and gentle, as baby\u2019s just starting to stretch out!\n\n\u{1F30A} 20-24 Weeks: By now, you may notice rolling waves as baby moves and wiggles, finding new positions in there.\n\n\u{1F90F}\u{1F3FD} 24-32 Weeks: Baby\u2019s got some strength! You\u2019ll feel nudges and small kicks, almost like little thumps saying, \u201CHey, Mom!\u201D\n\n\u{1F94B} 32-40 Weeks: At this stage, baby\u2019s a pro! Expect karate kicks and wrestling moves as they make the most of every inch they have left.\n\n\u{1F505}While these are common timeframes, some factors - like the position of the placenta or baby\u2019s position - can affect what you feel and when. \n\n\u203C\uFE0FIf you\u2019re unsure about baby\u2019s movements, or notice a decrease in activity, it\u2019s always best to check in with your doctor.\n\n#babykicks #firsttimemom #babymovement #pregnancy #firsttrimester #secondtrimester #thirstrimester #activebaby #pregnant #baby #babies #babiesofinstagram #fyp #obgyn #womenshealth #pregnantbelly #belly #kicks #movement #healthypregnancy #healthy #fitness #ahmedabad #instagram #instadaily #cute #cutebaby #parenting \n\n\u{1F9D0}First-time moms, how did you feel when you first experienced baby kicks?",
