    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "Childbirth is a remarkable journey that deserves comprehensive preparation. While exercises like deep squats and duck walks can benefit pelvic floor health, they are not a guaranteed path to vaginal delivery.\n\nTrue childbirth education goes beyond physical fitness. Understanding the intricacies of the pelvis \u2013 its inlet, midpelvis, and outlet \u2013 is crucial. Each of these areas must open for a baby to pass through smoothly.\n\nA holistic approach to prenatal education equips mothers with the knowledge and tools for a positive birth experience. This includes tailored exercises, effective breathing techniques, pain management strategies, and exploring various birthing positions. By understanding their bodies and options, women can feel confident and empowered as they embark on this incredible chapter.\n\nContact us on +91 95585 83559 & Visit us today!",
