    instagramCaption:
      "\u2B50\uFE0FJoin us as we explore the incredible benefits of exercising during pregnancy! \n\n\u27A1\uFE0FRegular exercise during pregnancy offers numerous advantages:\n\n\u{1F538}Enhanced Cardiovascular Health: Improves your heart health and prepares your body for the increased demands of pregnancy.\n\u{1F538}Musculoskeletal Strength: Strengthens your muscles and joints, reducing the risk of back pain and other discomforts.\n\u{1F538}Weight Management: Helps maintain a healthy weight, preventing excessive weight gain and gestational diabetes.\n\u{1F538}Mental Well-being: Boosts your mood and reduces symptoms of prenatal depression and anxiety through the release of endorphins.\n\u{1F538}Easier Labor and Delivery: Improves endurance and muscle tone, potentially leading to a smoother labor process.\n\u{1F538}Postpartum Recovery: Aids in a quicker and more efficient recovery after childbirth.\n\n\u{1F505}Partnering with a professional can make a significant difference in your pregnancy journey, ensuring both you and your baby stay healthy and strong.\u{1FA77}\n\n\u{1F913}Fun fact - I keep on correcting patient\u2019s form and use too many verbal and tactile cues which can be beneficial and maybe annoying at the same time but I ensure you that you\u2019ll have a great time!\u{1F604}\n\n\u{1F48C}DM us for more information or to book a consultation!\u{1F607}\n\nDr. Zalak Shah (PT) \nWomen\u2019s Health Physiotherapist \nSTOTT Pilates instructor \n\u{1F4E7} contact@womenshealthduo.com\n\u{1F4DE} +91-7990550754\n\n[Pregnancy, Prenatal exercises, Prenatal Pilates, Pilates, Antenatal exercises, Low back pain during pregnancy, post-partum, Third trimester, Obs Gynec Physio, Posture correction, pelvic floor exercises, Birthing ball, Swiss ball, Physio ball, Labor and delivery, Trending, Women\u2019s Health Physiotherapist, Ahmedabad, India]\n\n\u{1F9D0}Are you pregnant and don\u2019t know where and how to start with an exercise routine? Do you want to know more?",
