    instagramCaption:
      "\u2728Protect yourself and your partner!\u{1F9A0}\n\n\u27A1\uFE0FSafeguard against sexually transmitted infections (STIs) by practicing safe sex, using protection consistently, and getting tested regularly.\u{1F9EA}\n\n\u203C\uFE0FRemember, your sexual health is a priority. \n\n\u2728Let\u2019s normalize open conversations about STI prevention and empower everyone to make informed choices for a healthier future.\u{1F4AA}\u{1F3FD}\n\n\u{1F9D0}Questions about STIs or gynecological concerns? Contact us\u2014we\u2019re here to help.\n\n\u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0FDr. Charmi Shah (M.S. OBGYN)\nObstetrician & Gynaecologist\nLaparoscopic Surgeon\n\u{1F4DE} +91-7990550754\n\u{1F4E7} contact@womenshealthduo.com\n\n[ STIs, Sexually Transmitted Infections, Obstetrician and gynaecologist, STI Prevention, Medical and Health, Sexual Health, Ahmedabad, Gujarat ]",
