    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1FA77}This International Women\u2019s Day, let\u2019s honor our strength and resilience.\u{1F4AA}\u{1F3FD}\n\nWhen it comes to women\u2019s health, exercise is key, especially in managing those pesky menstrual cramps.\u{1FA78}\nIntroducing Forest Elixir\u2019s Menstrual Pain Relief Elixir \u2013 an Ayurvedic blend infused with essential oils designed specifically to ease period discomfort.\u{1F33F} \nSay goodbye to pain and hello to relief with our natural solution!\u2728\n\n[International Women\u2019s Day, Menstrual Pain Relief Elixir, Women\u2019s Health Physiotherapist, Pilates Instructor, Forest Elixir, Women\u2019s Health, Physical therapy]",
