    topics: ["Fertility", "Pregnancy", "Reels"],
    title: "Women's Health Duo ,  Instagram Reel",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}Pregnancy - It\u2019s the perfect orchestration of biology and nothing short of a miracle. All the right pieces at just the right time creating life. It never fails to amaze, and each pregnancy is just as remarkable as the next. \n\n\u{1F538}Unfortunately, if all the pieces don\u2019t come together in the right way, pregnancy may not always successful. One such complication in the process of creating life is an ectopic pregnancy. \n\n\u{1F538}Although rare, it\u2019s important to diagnose and treat an ectopic pregnancy early on.\n\n\u2757\uFE0FAn ectopic pregnancy can quickly become life-threatening!\nTherefore always consult a Gynaecologist if you suspect that you are pregnant! \u{1FA7A}\n\n[Ectopic pregnancy, pregnancy, Prenatal, Ovaries, Fallopian tubes, Embryo, Uterus, Fertility, Gynaecologist, Obstetrician]",
