    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "How Does Emergency Contraception Work? \u{1F50D}\n\nEver wondered about the science behind emergency contraception? \u{1F914} \n\u{1F469}\u{1F3FB}\u200D\u2695\uFE0FLet's break it down:\n\n\u{1F539} Timing is Key: Emergency contraception primarily works by delaying or preventing ovulation \u2013 the release of an egg from the ovary. It's most effective when taken as soon as possible after unprotected intercourse.\n\n\u{1F539} Thickening the Gates: Some methods create a thicker cervical mucus, making it harder for sperm to reach the egg.\n\n\u{1F539} Unwelcoming Environment: Emergency contraception can also alter the lining of the uterus, making it less hospitable for a fertilized egg to implant.\n\n\u{1F4CC}Remember, these methods are not 100% foolproof. \n\u{1F48C}If you're concerned about unwanted pregnancy or have questions DM us.\u{1F31F}",
