    title: "Women's Health Duo ,  Instagram Reel",
    summary: "Patient education from @womenshealthduo on Instagram.",
    instagramCaption:
      "\u2728 BIRTHING BALL \u2728\n\nWant to help reduce pain during labor? Then MOVE.. with the help of a Birthing ball!\n\n\u{1F930}\u{1F3FB}Birthing ball is a popular tool used during pregnancy and labor. These are designed to support the mother's body during labor and delivery.\n\n\u27A1\uFE0FHere are some benefits of using a Birthing ball:\n- encourages movement\n- relieves discomfort\n- speeds up labor \n- provides support\n- facilitates cervical dilation and pushing \n\n\u{1F4CC}It is important to note that while a Birthing ball can be a helpful tool, they should be used under guidance of a Women's Health Physiotherapist so that they can provide guidance on appropriate size of ball and best position to use for your individual needs.\n\n\u{1F48C}DM us to know more about labor management techniques!\u{1F60A}",
